Third-Party Data Sources
================================================================================

FoJin aggregates Buddhist digital text data from the following third-party
sources. Each source's content is subject to its own license terms. FoJin's
Apache 2.0 license applies only to the FoJin source code itself, NOT to the
content obtained from these data sources.

Users and deployers are responsible for complying with each data source's
license when using FoJin.

